---
const { href, coverSrc } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="book-cta" aria-labelledby="book-cta-title">
  <div class="cover-wrap">
    <img
      src={coverSrc}
      alt="Cover of The First 30 Days as a New Manager by Plain Act"
      width="800"
      height="1200"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="book-copy">
    <p class="book-kicker">Practical field manual</p>
    <h2 id="book-cta-title">The First 30 Days as a New Manager</h2>
    <p>The article gives you the sequence. The book goes deeper into delegation, feedback, boundaries, pushback, managing up, and decision timing under pressure.</p>
    <a class="book-button" href={href}>See the 30-Day Management Manual</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .book-cta {
    width: min(100%, 980px);
    margin: 6rem auto 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 250px) 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: #f0eadf;
  }
  .cover-wrap { max-width: 230px; }
  img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid #cfc5b5;
    background: var(--paper);
  }
  .book-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 .65rem;
    font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: .76rem;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); max-width: 15ch; }
  .book-copy > p:not(.book-kicker) { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 58ch; }
  .book-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 46px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: .9rem;
    padding: .78rem 1.05rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .book-cta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.8rem; padding: 1.5rem; margin-top: 4.5rem; }
    .cover-wrap { width: min(62vw, 230px); }
    .book-button { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
